<title>UK: BFI falls eight to 1,442, conditions flat.</title>
<headline>BFI falls eight to 1,442, conditions flat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spot Baltic Freight Index (BFI) fell eight points on Wednesday to 1,442.</p>
<p>Brokers said market conditions for Capers and Handysizes remained flat, although new orders had encouraged Panamax owners in the Atlantic to resist a further decline in rates.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
